        minor MATLAB cleanup.
    * COLAMD 2.5.2:
        minor MATLAB cleanup
    * CSparse 2.0.7:
        minor MATLAB cleanup
    * CXSparse 2.0.7:
        minor MATLAB cleanup
    * LDL 1.3.4:
        minor MATLAB cleanup
    * UMFPACK 5.0.3:
        minor MATLAB cleanup

Dec 7, 2006: SuiteSparse version 2.3.1
    minor update

    * CSparse 2.0.6:
        update to UFget
    * CXSparse 2.0.6:
        update to UFget

Dec 2, 2006: SuiteSparse version 2.3.0
